{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20340","headline":"奉和舍人叔直省时思琴 · 张籍","name":"奉和舍人叔直省时思琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼紫薇直，秋意深无穷。\n滴沥仙阁漏，肃穆禁池风。\n竹月泛凉影，萱露澹幽丛。\n地清物态胜，宵闲琴思通。\n时属雅音际，逈凝虚抱中。\n达人掌枢近，常与隐默同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}